  "content": "\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><strong>Better Enchantments</strong> 增强了《Minecraft》的附魔系统，添加了数值平衡的新附魔、专属附魔书、更完善的进度系统、宝藏附魔，以及能够无缝融入原版玩法的新机制，在保留《Minecraft》核心体验的同时，为玩家提供更多自定义装备的方式。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
